=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Rasdinice}.
* Travel to the Beastman Ensign at (J-7) in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)}.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Everbloom Hollow}.
* A line of 3 Orcs will immediately start slowly running towards the exit.
** {m:Orcish Carrier} - Will Occasionally run away while fighting. Susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}
** {m:Orcish Grunt} x2 - Links with the {m:Orcish Carrier}, does not run. Susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}
** Should the {m:Orcish Carrier} make it to the end of the area, which is quite large, the mission is failed.
* Once all three Orcs are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
* **Exit at the Twilight Aureole to complete the mission.**
* Return and talk to {n:Rasdinice} for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to {z:Everbloom Hollow}.
* All 3 of the Orc are Susceptible to {s:Sleep} and {s:Gravity}.
* Repetative stun/sleep/bind is helpful in this battle.
* The Orc are very weak.
** Approximately 2500 HP each.
* Be sure to exit at the Twilight Aureole  to complete the mission.
* The Orcs will warp out if you fail to kill the Carrier quickly enough.
* The following actions will cause you to fail this mission:
** Leaving before killing the Orcs
** Warping out directly after killing the Orcs

